moose-vale
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The rules under styles/Voices/, styles/Direct/, styles/Moose/, and styles/Std/
are copied from moose-vale (https://github.com/hawkeyexl/moose-vale),
Copyright (c) 2026 Manny Silva, licensed under the MIT License. They were taken
from release v0.3.3, commit 729c092652d6 (2026-09-03), without modification.

moose-vale in turn vendors Vale Voices (https://github.com/jdkato/voices) and
Vale's standard library (https://github.com/vale-cli/Std), both MIT licensed,
with the rule fixes it records. Those upstream notices ship beside the rules:
styles/Voices/NOTICE and styles/Direct/NOTICE are moose-vale's NOTICE, and
styles/Std/NOTICE is Std's own.

To refresh, copy the four style directories from a newer moose-vale release
into styles/, update the release and commit above, run Vale over
src/content/docs, and push to main. The release workflow republishes the zip.
